## Continuation Update 13 (2026-04-15)
- Continued Windows staging scan performance work by reducing per-entry filesystem syscalls:
  - Refactored `visit_dir_win32` in `src/scan.rs` to consume `WIN32_FIND_DATAW` directly for:
