    - modified time (`ftLastWriteTime`) via FILETIME conversion helper
  - Removed per-child `symlink_metadata` calls from the Win32 scan path.
  - Preserved deterministic ordering, `.caravan` exclusion, and non-Windows fallback behavior.
- Added focused conversion tests in `src/scan.rs` for FILETIME -> `SystemTime`:
  - pre-UNIX epoch returns `None`
  - UNIX epoch boundary conversion
  - sub-second precision handling
