## Continuation Update 17 (2026-04-15)
- Implemented snapshot destination configurability hardening and operator visibility improvements:
  - CLI/config guard: `--snapshot-dir` now requires `--snapshot-every`.
    - `src/cli/config_builder.rs`
    - `tests/cli_tests.rs`
  - Added fail-fast snapshot configuration validation:
    - rejects staging-mode snapshot settings
    - rejects zero cadence
    - requires snapshot dir to exist and be a directory
    - on Linux, requires snapshot dir and destination to be on same filesystem
    - rejects snapshot dir inside destination subtree
    - resolves canonical paths so `..` segments are handled correctly
    - `src/snapshot.rs`
    - `tests/snapshot_tests.rs`
  - Validation is executed both:
    - early in transfer/resume startup
    - again in snapshot processing (defense in depth)
    - `src/cli/commands/transfer/mod.rs`
    - `src/cli/commands/resume/mod.rs`
    - `src/snapshot.rs`
  - Snapshot policy is now visible to operators:
    - `status` output shows cadence and snapshot directory
    - transfer/resume startup output shows cadence and snapshot directory
    - `src/cli/commands/shared/output.rs`
    - `src/cli/commands/status.rs`
